  "implementationNotes": [
    "Includes all 98 uploaded MP3 files whose filenames carry a numeric Surah/ayah identifier: Al-Fatihah 1:1–7, Al-Anfal 8:1–75, and the supplied Maryam 19 ayahs 77–81 and 88–98.",
    "The two unresolved C00 files were removed from the repository and are not part of the rescue catalogue.",
    "Existing nine selected entries retain their Arabic ayah text. Other entries display their verified filename-derived Surah and ayah reference without fabricated Arabic text; the full Arabic text can be added after a reliable source cross-check.",
    "Durations for the additional files are estimated from MP3 byte size using the observed constant 56 kbps encoding, calibrated against the 29 files whose durations were measured directly; the measured sample fit is within approximately 0.006 seconds.",
    "Age profiles preserve the existing duration limits: under_8 up to 25 seconds, 8_to_15 up to 45 seconds, and 16_plus/parents up to 75 seconds.",
    "Listening rescue awards exactly one heart only after natural completion of the selected audio. No autoplay, no seeking-to-end reward, and no ads or payments.",
    "The existing quiz rescue remains a free fallback if the audio catalogue or playback is unavailable."
  ]
